                <head>330. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>The Foreign Ministers did not meet on Saturday May 23 or Sunday May 24. However,
                    at 10:30 a.m. on May 24 Secretary of State Herter discussed at length with Couve de Murville questions affecting U.S.-French relations. A
                    memorandum of their conversation is printed in <ref
                        target="frus:frus1958-60v07p2">volume VII, Part 2, Document 116</ref>.</p>
            </div>
